    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>The Kind Site Framework plugin is a collection of configurable tools (block patterns, block templates, schema scripts etc.) that makes it easy to make your WordPress site modern, elegant and SEO-rich.</p>\n<h3>Post Installation</h3>\n<p>Once our plugin is installed and activated, navigate to Settings &gt; Kind Site Framework to configure schema.org scripts and manage other plugin&#8217;s settings.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>There are two ways to install the Kind Site Framework plugin:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Manually</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Simply download the plugin and extract the &#8220;kind-wp-site-framework&#8221; plugin folder. Upload this folder to your /wp-content/plugins folder on your server, navigate to the Plugins page in /wp-admin and press &#8220;activate&#8221; under Kind Site Framework.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>WordPress</li>\n</ol>\n<p>You may also install the Kind Site Framework plugin via your WordPress dashboard. Simply navigate to Plugins &gt; Add New and search for &#8220;Kind Site Framework&#8221;. Then click &#8220;install now&#8221; on our plugin. Once it is installed press &#8220;activate&#8221; and you are ready to go!</p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"what%20is%20kind%20creative%3F\">\nWhat is Kind Creative?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>As we help scale your business, we scale our own social impact. At Kind Creative, we believe in mission over margins and practice altruistic marketing.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"will%20this%20slow%20down%20my%20site%3F\">\nWill this slow down my site?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Not at all! Our plugin is incredibly small and light-weight and will not interfere with the performance of your site in the slightest.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<p><strong>Version 1.0.0 – Released on January 14, 2026</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "A modern block-based framework providing reusable patterns, templates, and schema tools for WordPress sites.",
